    smbd listening:
      LISTEN 0      50           0.0.0.0:445        0.0.0.0:*          
      LISTEN 0      50              [::]:445           [::]:*          

    the share as the server advertises it:
      
      	Sharename       Type      Comment
      	---------       ----      -------
      	task01          Disk      Task 01 export from Linux to Windows
      	IPC$            IPC       IPC Service (Task01 Linux SMB server)
      SMB1 disabled -- no workgroup available
[PASS] Samba is listening on 445 on the WSL VM interface

    enforced protocol settings:
