--- 2. can WINDOWS reach it? ---
    Testing from the Windows side with Test-NetConnection.
    Test-NetConnection 192.168.65.3:445 -> False
    route to 172.25.112.0/20 via: vEthernet (WSL (Hyper-V firewall))
[FAIL] Windows cannot reach 192.168.65.3:445

    NETWORK TOPOLOGY, read from the namespaces:

      WSL distro  netns 4026531840   eth0 172.25.112.168/20
      container   netns 4026532218   eth0 192.168.65.3/24

      Docker Desktop places containers in a network namespace of
      their own, distinct from the WSL distro. Windows routes to
      172.25.112.0/20, so a Windows client reaches an SMB server
      that listens in the distro namespace. Three properties of
      this host were measured and shape that route:

      1. Windows reaches the WSL distro directly. A listener on
         172.25.112.168:4446 answered Test-NetConnection with True,
         so the Hyper-V firewall permits the path even with
         DefaultInboundAction set to Block.
      2. Windows itself holds 0.0.0.0:445 (PID 4, System), and the
         Windows SMB client connects only on 445, so the server
         must own that port on an address Windows routes to.
      3. The Docker Desktop distro ships busybox only, so the
         forwarding tools live on the serving host, not in it.

    MAPPING PROCEDURE for a Windows client, from these measurements:

      Serve Samba from the WSL distro itself, which already holds a
      Windows-routable address:

        wsl --install -d Ubuntu
        sudo apt-get install -y samba && sudo smbpasswd -a $USER
        # copy linuxbox/smb.conf, then: sudo systemctl start smbd

      Then map it from Windows, persistently:

        net use Z: \\172.25.112.168\task01linux /persistent:yes
        New-SmbMapping -LocalPath Z: -RemotePath \\172.25.112.168\task01linux -Persistent $true

      Alternatively, publish the container to a Windows-routable
      address with an elevated portproxy:

        netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 listenport=445 \
              listenaddress=172.25.112.168 connectport=445 \
              connectaddress=192.168.65.3

